{"seq":1,"slug":"main-group-chemistry","title":"主族元素化学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/inorganic-chemistry/descriptive-chemistry/main-group-chemistry","wordCount":1636,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"主族元素化学\">主族元素化学</h1><p>一块钠丢进水里炸出火光，一瓶氦气却任你怎么折腾都纹丝不动——同在主族，元素的脾气竟天差地别。主族元素（s 区与 p 区）占据周期表两翼，构成了我们日常接触的绝大多数物质：空气、水、岩石、生命的骨架。这一篇是主族描述化学的唯一详讲处，它把<a href=\"atomic-structure-periodicity\">原子结构与周期性</a>的趋势落到一族族具体元素上，看规律如何上演。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>主族元素的化学由最外层 s、p 电子主导，族号（旧式 I A–VIII A）直接对应价电子数，也大体决定主要氧化态。一条贯穿全篇的规律是：同族从上到下金属性增强、非金属性减弱；同周期从左到右则相反。另一条是「对角线规则」——某些左上与右下相邻元素（如 Li 与 Mg、Be 与 Al）性质相似，源于电荷半径比相近。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[主族元素] --&gt; B[s 区&lt;br/&gt;I A 碱金属 / II A 碱土]&#10;  A --&gt; C[p 区&lt;br/&gt;III A 到 VIII A]&#10;  B --&gt; D[强还原性&lt;br/&gt;金属性向下增强]&#10;  C --&gt; E[III A 缺电子]&#10;  C --&gt; F[IV A 到 VI A 多价态]&#10;  C --&gt; G[VII A 卤素 强氧化]&#10;  C --&gt; H[VIII A 稀有气体 惰性]\">flowchart TD\n  A[主族元素] --&gt; B[s 区&lt;br/&gt;I A 碱金属 / II A 碱土]\n  A --&gt; C[p 区&lt;br/&gt;III A 到 VIII A]\n  B --&gt; D[强还原性&lt;br/&gt;金属性向下增强]\n  C --&gt; E[III A 缺电子]\n  C --&gt; F[IV A 到 VI A 多价态]\n  C --&gt; G[VII A 卤素 强氧化]\n  C --&gt; H[VIII A 稀有气体 惰性]</pre><h2 id=\"s-区-碱金属与碱土金属\">s 区：碱金属与碱土金属</h2><p>碱金属（I A）只有一个松散的 ns¹ 电子，极易失去成 +1 离子，是最强的金属还原剂。从锂到铯，电离能递减、活泼性递增，与水反应一个比一个剧烈。它们的焰色反应（钠黄、钾紫）源于电子激发后回落发光，是定性鉴定的经典手段。碱土金属（II A）失去两个 ns² 电子成 +2 离子，活泼性略逊于同周期碱金属。铍因半径极小、电荷密度高，表现出明显的共价倾向与对角线相似性（与铝类似）。</p>\n<p>s 区元素的强还原性使它们在自然界只以化合态存在，工业上靠电解熔融盐制取。它们的离子半径与电荷决定其盐类的晶格能与溶解度规律，相关晶格能原理见<a href=\"../atoms-bonding/ionic-covalent-bonding\">离子键与共价键理论</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"p-区-从缺电子到惰性气体\">p 区：从缺电子到惰性气体</h2><p>p 区是主族多样性的核心。III A 的硼是典型缺电子元素，只有三个价电子却有四条价轨道，故 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>BF</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{BF}_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BF</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是强 Lewis 酸、硼烷形成奇特的三中心两电子桥键。铝则兼具金属性与两性（既溶于酸又溶于碱）。</p>\n<p>IV A 到 VI A 元素呈现丰富的多价态：碳的 +4 与 −4、氮的 −3 到 +5 全跨度、硫的 −2、+4、+6。第二周期元素（C、N、O）因半径小、易形成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 多重键（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>N</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{N}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">N</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 三键、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 双键），而同族较重元素更倾向单键链状或聚合（磷、硫的同素异形体）。这种「第二周期反常」是主族化学的重要主题。</p>\n<p>VII A 卤素是最活泼的非金属，ns²np⁵ 组态只差一个电子达稀有气体构型，故为强氧化剂，氧化性从氟到碘递减。VIII A 稀有气体满壳层、极惰性，但氙在强氧化条件下仍能生成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>XeF</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{XeF}_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">XeF</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>XeO</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{XeO}_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">XeO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 等超价化合物——其几何用 VSEPR 即可预测，详见<a href=\"../atoms-bonding/molecular-geometry-vsepr-hybridization\">分子几何、VSEPR 与杂化</a>。</p>\n<p>下表小结 p 区各族特征：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>族</th>\n<th>价电子</th>\n<th>典型氧化态</th>\n<th>代表性质</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>III A</td>\n<td>ns²np¹</td>\n<td>+3</td>\n<td>硼缺电子、铝两性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IV A</td>\n<td>ns²np²</td>\n<td>+4, +2, −4</td>\n<td>碳成链、硅成网</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>V A</td>\n<td>ns²np³</td>\n<td>−3 到 +5</td>\n<td>氮多键、磷多价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VI A</td>\n<td>ns²np⁴</td>\n<td>−2, +4, +6</td>\n<td>氧强电负、硫多价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VII A</td>\n<td>ns²np⁵</td>\n<td>−1 到 +7</td>\n<td>卤素强氧化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VIII A</td>\n<td>ns²np⁶</td>\n<td>0（Xe 例外）</td>\n<td>满壳层惰性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"周期性规律的统一解释\">周期性规律的统一解释</h2><p>主族元素看似零散的性质，其实都能用三条周期性趋势串起来：金属性强弱取决于电离能（向左下增强），氧化能力取决于电子亲和与电负性（向右上增强），化合物的酸碱性则随氧化态升高、半径减小而趋酸。例如同周期氧化物从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Na</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>O</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Na}_2\\text{O}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Na</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span></span></span></span></span>（碱性）经 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Al</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>O</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Al}_2\\text{O}_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Al</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（两性）到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>SO</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SO}_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（酸性），正是电负性递增的直接体现。这种「用趋势解释事实」的思路，比死记每种化合物高效得多，也是描述化学应有的学法。重元素的某些反常（如惰性电子对效应使 Tl⁺、Pb²⁺ 更稳定）则与相对论效应有关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"含氧酸与氢化物的递变规律\">含氧酸与氢化物的递变规律</h2><p>主族元素的两大类衍生物——含氧酸与氢化物——本身就藏着漂亮的周期规律，是检验「用趋势解释事实」的好试金石。含氧酸 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>HO</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>E</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>O</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{HO}-\\text{E}=\\text{O}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HO</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">E</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的酸性强弱可用鲍林规则估计：非羟基氧原子越多，酸性越强，因为多出的氧能更好地分散共轭碱的负电荷。于是同一元素中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>HClO</mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mtext>HClO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mtext>HClO</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mtext>HClO</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{HClO} &lt; \\text{HClO}_2 &lt; \\text{HClO}_3 &lt; \\text{HClO}_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HClO</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HClO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HClO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HClO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 酸性递增，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>HClO</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{HClO}_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HClO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 成为最强的常见无机酸之一；横向比较，中心原子电负性越大酸性越强，故 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>SO</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mtext>PO</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{H}_2\\text{SO}_4 &gt; \\text{H}_3\\text{PO}_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>氢化物的规律则分两条线。热稳定性随中心原子电负性减弱、键能下降而降低，故同族从上到下（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>HF</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>HCl</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>HBr</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>HI</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{HF} &gt; \\text{HCl} &gt; \\text{HBr} &gt; \\text{HI}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HF</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HCl</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HBr</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HI</span></span></span></span></span></span>）热稳定性递减。酸性却相反地从上到下递增——尽管 H—F 键极性最大，但 H—I 键能最弱、最易解离，所以氢碘酸是强酸而氢氟酸是弱酸。这个「极性大未必酸性强」的反差，是初学者最易出错处，根子在于酸性由键能（解离难易）而非键极性主导。这些规律全都能回溯到<a href=\"atomic-structure-periodicity\">原子结构与周期性</a>的电负性与半径趋势。</p>\n<p>两类衍生物的递变方向恰好相反，值得并置对照：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>衍生物</th>\n<th>同族自上而下</th>\n<th>主导因素</th>\n<th>典型次序</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>氢化物</td>\n<td>热稳定性↓、酸性↑</td>\n<td>键能（解离难易）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>HF</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>HCl</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>HBr</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>HI</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{HF}&gt;\\text{HCl}&gt;\\text{HBr}&gt;\\text{HI}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HF</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HCl</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HBr</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HI</span></span></span></span></span></span>（稳定性）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>含氧酸</td>\n<td>非羟基氧越多酸性越强</td>\n<td>共轭碱电荷分散</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>HClO</mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mtext>HClO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mtext>HClO</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mtext>HClO</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{HClO}&lt;\\text{HClO}_2&lt;\\text{HClO}_3&lt;\\text{HClO}_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HClO</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HClO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HClO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HClO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>主族化学由 s、p 价电子主导，金属性沿族向下增强、沿周期向右减弱，并有对角线相似。</li>\n<li>s 区是强还原剂，只以化合态存在；铍、锂表现出对角线共价倾向。</li>\n<li>p 区从硼的缺电子、碳的成链到卤素的强氧化、稀有气体的惰性，多样性由价电子组态决定。</li>\n<li>第二周期多重键反常与重元素惰性电子对效应是两条贯穿全篇的细化规律。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"主族元素化学","id":"主族元素化学"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"s 区：碱金属与碱土金属","id":"s-区-碱金属与碱土金属"},{"level":2,"text":"p 区：从缺电子到惰性气体","id":"p-区-从缺电子到惰性气体"},{"level":2,"text":"周期性规律的统一解释","id":"周期性规律的统一解释"},{"level":2,"text":"含氧酸与氢化物的递变规律","id":"含氧酸与氢化物的递变规律"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"配合物的反应与异构现象","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/inorganic-chemistry/coordination-chemistry/complex-reactions-isomerism"},"next":{"title":"过渡金属化学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/inorganic-chemistry/descriptive-chemistry/transition-metal-chemistry"}}